ent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 26px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">Over het realiseren en verzekeren van langdurige, duurzame impact lees je meer op de </span><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW50102022 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 26px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">theorie-pagina</span><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW50102022 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 26px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">. Bekijk de </span><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW50102022 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 26px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">praktijk-pagina </span><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW50102022 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 26px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">voor aanpakken van anderen.</span><span class="EOP SCXW50102022 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 26px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div></h2></body>
